{"id":"n67897-1-7","stage":1,"title":"새해 · 新年","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67897-1-7-1","ko":"2010년이 가고 드디어 새해 아침이 밝았네요.","zh":"2010年已经过去，终于迎来了新年的早晨啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"2010년이","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年；2010：数字。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가고","meaning":"过","explanation":"가다：过；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"27","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새해","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침이","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밝았네요.","meaning":"亮，天亮","explanation":"밝다：亮，天亮；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64746","senseId":"2","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e23df8834a583975","term":"년","zh":"年","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3","entryId":"26823","definition":"计算年度的数量单位。","pronunciation":["년"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"过","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"时间经过或消逝。","pronunciation":